          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\mu = \\sum x P(x) = 0(0.49) + 1(0.05) + 2(0.32) + 3(0.07) + 4(0.07) = 0.05+0.64+0.21+0.28 = 1.18$. $E[X^2] = 0 + 1(0.05) + 4(0.32) + 9(0.07) + 16(0.07) = 0.05+1.28+0.63+1.12 = 3.08$. $\\sigma^2 = 3.08 - 1.18^2 = 3.08 - 1.3924 = 1.6876$, so $\\sigma = \\sqrt{1.6876} \\approx 1.30$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\mu = \\sum x P(x) = 0(0.49) + 1(0.05) + 2(0.32) + 3(0.07) + 4(0.07) = 0.05+0.64+0.21+0.28 = 1.18$. $E[X^2] = 0 + 1(0.05) + 4(0.32) + 9(0.07) + 16(0.07) = 0.05+1.28+0.63+1.12 = 3.08$. $\\sigma^2 = 3.08 - 1.18^2 = 3.08 - 1.3924 = 1.6876$, nên $\\sigma = \\sqrt{1.6876} \\approx 1.30$.</p></div>"
