          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1 = 320/400 = 0.8$, $\\hat{p}_2 = 210/300 = 0.7$, difference $= 0.1$. $SE = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{0.8(0.2)}{400} + \\dfrac{0.7(0.3)}{300}} = \\sqrt{0.0004 + 0.0007} = \\sqrt{0.0011} = 0.03317$. For 90% confidence, $z_{0.05} = 1.65$: margin $= 1.65 \\times 0.03317 = 0.0547$. CI $= 0.1 \\pm 0.055 = (0.045,\\ 0.155) \\approx (0.05,\\ 0.15)$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1 = 320/400 = 0.8$, $\\hat{p}_2 = 210/300 = 0.7$, hiệu $= 0.1$. $SE = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{0.8(0.2)}{400} + \\dfrac{0.7(0.3)}{300}} = \\sqrt{0.0004 + 0.0007} = \\sqrt{0.0011} = 0.03317$. Với độ tin cậy 90%, $z_{0.05} = 1.65$: biên sai số $= 1.65 \\times 0.03317 = 0.0547$. Khoảng tin cậy $= 0.1 \\pm 0.055 = (0.045,\\ 0.155) \\approx (0.05,\\ 0.15)$.</p></div>"
