          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\bar{x} = 52/4 = 13$, $\\bar{y} = 34/4 = 8.5$. $S_{xy} = \\sum(x-\\bar{x})(y-\\bar{y}) = (-3)(-0.5) + (-1)(1.5) + (0)(-2.5) + (4)(1.5) = 1.5 - 1.5 + 0 + 6 = 6$. $S_{xx} = 9 + 1 + 0 + 16 = 26$. So $b = 6/26 = 0.2308 \\approx 0.23$ and $a = 8.5 - 0.2308(13) = 8.5 - 3 = 5.5$. The line is $\\hat{y} = 5.5 + 0.23x$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\bar{x} = 52/4 = 13$, $\\bar{y} = 34/4 = 8.5$. $S_{xy} = \\sum(x-\\bar{x})(y-\\bar{y}) = (-3)(-0.5) + (-1)(1.5) + (0)(-2.5) + (4)(1.5) = 1.5 - 1.5 + 0 + 6 = 6$. $S_{xx} = 9 + 1 + 0 + 16 = 26$. Vậy $b = 6/26 = 0.2308 \\approx 0.23$ và $a = 8.5 - 0.2308(13) = 8.5 - 3 = 5.5$. Đường hồi quy là $\\hat{y} = 5.5 + 0.23x$.</p></div>"
